+INQUISITION
+Far underneath the bedrock of Antarctica
+on Holy Terra exists the citadel of an
+organization that acts as the secret
+police of the Imperium of Man, hunting
+down any and all threats to the stability
+of the God-Emperor's realm. The
+most shadowy and mysterious of the
+Emperor’s organizations, it is responsible
+for defending against perils of heresy,
+possession, alien dominance and
+rebellion. It is they who stand between all
+mankind and the phantoms of fear and
+terror lurking in the darkness between
+the stars.
